16502","title":"步蟾宫","author":"宋 · 章耐轩","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"未开大如木犀蕊。","body":91},{"id":"song:16503","title":"浣溪沙","author":"宋 · 昭顺老人","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"的皪堪为席上珍。","body":91},{"id":"song:16504","title":"南柯子・南歌子","author":"宋 · 陈舜翁","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"德祖家珍熟，钱塘五月中。","body":91},{"id":"song:16505","title":"浪淘沙","author":"宋 · 洪子大","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"上苑又春残。","body":91},{"id":"song:16506","title":"八声甘州","author":"宋 · 郑子玉","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"渐莺声近也，探年芳、河畔扼轻轮。","body":91},{"id":"song:16507","title":"虞美人","author":"宋 · 文珏","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"歌唇乍启尘飞处。","body":91},{"id":"song:16508","title":"虞美人","author":"宋 · 顾卞","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"帐前草草军情变。","body":91},{"id":"song:16509","title":"壶中天・念奴娇","author":"宋 · 陈景沂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"江邮湘驿。","body":91},{"id":"song:16510","title":"点绛唇","author":"宋 · 陈景沂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"今古凡花，词人尚作词称庆。","body":91},{"id":"song:16511","title":"水龙吟","author":"宋 · 陈景沂","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"阶前砌下新凉，嫩姿弱质婆娑小。","body":91}]